---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About William Peytz — AI engineer, startup builder, and MSc Human-Centered AI student at DTU."
>
  <section class="container-content py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tightest">About</h1>

    <div class="prose-site mt-8">
      <p>
        I'm an AI engineer and startup builder based in Copenhagen. I'm
        currently doing my MSc in Human-Centered AI at the Technical
        University of Denmark, where my coursework has taken me through
        deep learning, computer vision, computer graphics, and X-Tech
        entrepreneurship.
      </p>
      <p>
        What I care about is the gap between an interesting model and a
        product someone actually wants to use. That's pulled me toward
        rapid prototyping, full-stack development, and shipping AI systems
        with real users — adaptive learning platforms, voice agents,
        anomaly detection pipelines.
      </p>

      <h2>Currently</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Cofounding <strong><a href="/projects/stemma">Stemma</a></strong> — a Danish-speaking AI phone
          assistant for inbound calls (scheduling, bookings, sales). I
          designed and deployed the real-time ASR → LLM → TTS voice
          pipeline and we're running pilots with live customers.
        </li>
        <li>
          Studying at DTU — Deep Learning, Computer Vision, Computer
          Graphics, X-Tech Entrepreneurship.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Previously</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Cofounded <strong><a href="/projects/simbolic">Simbolic</a></strong> (2025–2026) — infrastructure
          for orchestrating engineering simulations across tools.
        </li>
        <li>
          BSc in Artificial Intelligence and Data at DTU. Thesis on
          adaptive learning systems, which became <a href="/projects/eloquiz">EloQuiz.dk</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Math tutor at Toptutors. IT &amp; legal assistant at Mette
          Klingsten Law Firm, where I automated CRM and document workflows.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Toolkit</h2>
      <p>
        Mostly Python (PyTorch, Flask, FastAPI, scikit-learn) and
        TypeScript/JavaScript (Vue, React). Comfortable with Docker,
        Firebase, Supabase, and shipping on Vercel. I work with LLMs,
        voice pipelines, and the OpenAI API daily.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        The fastest way to reach me is by{' '}
        <a href="mailto:williamhkp@gmail.com">email</a>. You can also find me
        on <a href="https://github.com/WPeytz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/William-Peytz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
